	"Description": "[b]This mod replaces the vanilla well with a functional well. Players can toss a diamond into the well to wish for a buff, and use the well to fast travel to the mine.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />1. Install SMAPI (if you haven't already).\n<br />2. Download and extract this mod.\n<br />3. Copy the mod folder into your Stardew Valley/Mods folder.\n<br />4. Launch the game through SMAPI.\n<br />\n<br />- Replaces the vanilla well with a new functional well.\n<br />- Wish at the well to receive a buff.\n<br />- Use the well to fast travel to the mine.\n<br />\n<br />[b]主要用途[/b]\n<br />本 Mod 将原版水井替换为功能水井。玩家可向水井丢入钻石许愿获得增益效果，并可通过水井快速到达矿井。\n<br />[b]安装步骤[/b]\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]安装 SMAPI（如果尚未安装）。[/*]\n<br />[*]下载并解压本 Mod。[/*]\n<br />[*]将 Mod 文件夹复制到\n<br />[code]Stardew Valley/Mods[/code]文件夹中。[/*]\n<br />[*]通过 SMAPI 启动游戏。[/*]\n<br />[/list][b]核心功能[/b]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]将原版水井替换为新的功能水井。[/*]\n<br />[*]向水井许愿可获得增益效果。[/*]\n<br />[*]可通过水井快速到达矿井。[/*]\n<br />[/list]",
